    Simple Domain: While
        Using: (x) -> item(x, 2) < 40000000
        Cursed Technique: Apply
            Consider a Of (x) -> item(x, 0).numa
            Consider b Of (x) -> item(x, 0).numb
            Consider newa As (a * 16807) % 2147483647
            Consider newb As (b * 48271) % 2147483647
            Consider mask As 65535
            Consider masker As (y) -> band(y, mask)
