                if masker(newa) = masker(newb)
                    then tuple(record("numa", newa, "numb", newb), item(x, 1) + 1, item(x, 2) + 1)
                    else tuple(record("numa", newa, "numb", newb), item(x, 1), item(x, 2) + 1)
    Cursed Technique: Apply
        Using: (x) -> item(x, 1)
